0..68 Comment "// The conversion subject\'s shared declarations: products, truncated"
69..135 Comment "// subtraction and numerals over the data subject\'s free naturals."
136..138 Comment "//"
139..216 Comment "// Each source of this subject states a closed computation as a path, and the"
217..292 Comment "// conversion settles the path by running its endpoints. The subject is the"
293..371 Comment "// benchmark set that measures a compiled conversion tier: the hotpath series\'"
372..401 Comment "// `conversion set` workload."
402..404 Comment "//"
405..481 Comment "// Products recurse on their second argument and add the first at each step."
482..559 Comment "// The numerals are values, so an endpoint reads them without running a call."
560..562 Comment "//"
563..619 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set these sources form"
621..689 Comment "// The free naturals, their addition and the numerals two and three."
